

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Prògram stiùireadh-cuimhne: 0.

>> txt := [' Word Salad '].
txt := txt cuir-an-àite: ['Word'] le: ['Ceasar'].
txt := txt beàrr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: txt, loidhne-ùr.

Prògram sgioblaich.

usedMemory1 := (Prògram cuimhne ? 0).


txt := [' Word Salad '].
txt := txt cuir-an-àite: ['Word'] le: ['Ceasar'].
txt := txt beàrr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: txt, loidhne-ùr.

